9
00:00:27.103 --> 00:00:32.608
It starts with a thought or an action triggering the parasympathetic nervous system.

10
00:00:32.608 --> 00:00:35.623
Then nitric oxide, a vasodilator, is released.

11
00:00:35.623 --> 00:00:41.324
The central artery, the other arterioles, and the mesh of spongy erectile tissue widen.

12
00:00:41.324 --> 00:00:45.715
More blood flows through the central artery into the spongy tissue.

13
00:00:45.715 --> 00:00:50.565
The corpora cavernosa fill with blood and press against their outer walls,

14
00:00:50.565 --> 00:00:55.415
squashing the veins, so blood can't flow back out, and the penis is rigid.

15
00:00:55.415 --> 00:00:58.888
Last, the blood is redirected back out into the body,

16
00:00:58.888 --> 00:01:01.706
