26
00:01:37.591 --> 00:01:41.155
Males secrete testosterone, FSH, and LH: all three.

27
00:01:41.155 --> 00:01:46.325
And if testosterone doesn't work during the development of a male's brain,

28
00:01:46.325 --> 00:01:51.845
